losses are positive numbers in dB.

125
00:09:18.084 --> 00:09:24.569
For an SWR of 1.5, the modulus of
gamma is 0.5 over 2.5, which is

126
00:09:24.609 --> 00:09:31.484
0.2, so the reflected power is 0.2
squared, 4 % of the incident power.

127
00:09:31.534 --> 00:09:36.523
An insertion loss of 0.5 dB means
the output power is ten to the

128
00:09:36.563 --> 00:09:44.272
